# Topics
**Parent:** [[knowledge-base]]

Durable knowledge that spans projects or belongs to none, one concept per note: `topics/<domain>/<topic>.md`, with `<domain>/<domain>.md` as each domain's index. Knowledge about one project lives in that project's `projects/<name>/knowledge/` folder instead (see [[docs/kb-page-standard]]). Every paragraph cites a [[sources]] note or a direct permalink. Rewritten in place as understanding improves (10 KB per note).

